msgid "LivQ AccessFix – EAA & A11y AutoFix"
msgstr "LivQ AccessFix – EAA & A11y AutoFix"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: livq-accessfix.php
msgid "https://skapacraft.com/tools/plugins/livq-accessfix/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: livq-accessfix.php
msgid ""
"Automated WCAG 2.2 AA & European Accessibility Act (EAA) remediation for "
"WordPress: focus styles, external link labels, skip links, alt attributes, "
"heading hierarchy, ARIA menus, and Gutenberg pre-publish checks - zero "
"configuration required."
msgstr ""
"Remédiation automatique WCAG 2.2 AA et European Accessibility Act (EAA) pour "
"WordPress : styles de focus, étiquettes de liens externes, liens de saut, "
"attributs alt, hiérarchie des titres, menus ARIA et vérifications pré-"
"publication Gutenberg - aucune configuration requise."

#. Author of the plugin
#: livq-accessfix.php
msgid "SkapaCraft"
msgstr ""

